<main class="api-key-page"><section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Administration</p><h1>Globale Commands</h1><p>Globale Commands gelten in allen Bot-Instanzen und haben Vorrang vor User-Commands.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>Globalen Template-Command speichern</h2><form method="POST" action="/Admin/Commands"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{data.csrf_token}}"><label>Name ohne Prefix <input name="name" maxlength="32" pattern="[a-z0-9_]+" required></label><label>Beschreibung <input name="description" maxlength="255"></label><label>Antwort <textarea name="response_template" maxlength="400" required></textarea></label><button class="button primary">Speichern</button></form></section><section class="card"><h2>Globale Commands</h2>{{#each data.commands}}<article><code>!{{name}}</code> — {{response_template}} <form method="POST" action="/Admin/Commands/{{id}}/Delete"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{../data.csrf_token}}"><button class="button danger">Löschen</button></form></article>{{else}}<p class="muted">Noch keine globalen Datenbank-Commands.</p>{{/each}}</section></main>
